for three years, and in that time the break room bulletin board had held the same three items: a fire evacuation map, a faded safety poster, and the schedule."}]]}],["$","p","1",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"On Monday there were four. A single sheet, printed that morning, listed the phone number for an employee assistance line, the hours of a new on-site counselor, and a sentence in bold: \"Conversations are confidential and are not shared with your supervisor.\""}]]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"By Wednesday, someone had taped a second copy inside the men's restroom, above the sink. By Friday there was one in the stairwell. Nobody announced them. Nobody mentioned them on the floor. But when Marcus walked past the stairwell copy on Friday afternoon, the strip of tear-off phone numbers along the bottom was already half gone."}]]}]]}],"$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 border-t border-eng-navy-100 pt-3 text-xs italic text-eng-navy-400","children":"Original passage — BEOC Academic Bridge"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-xl border-2 border-eng-teal-600 bg-white p-4 sm:p-6","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-eng-teal-700","children":"The question"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-900","children":"What can you conclude about the workers at the distribution center?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 mt-6 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-eng-teal-700","children":"Thinking it through"}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-eng-teal-700 text-sm font-bold text-white","aria-hidden":"true","children":1}],"$L26"]}],"$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a"]}],"$L2b","$L2c"]}